{"tts": [{"out": "gelen/ruya/b05/s01_0_NARRATOR.mp3", "voice": "Brian", "lang": "en", "text": "Some dreams are pictures. Some are places. And some\u2026 are songs.", "vs": {"stability": 0.45, "similarity_boost": 0.8, "style": 0.3}}, {"out": "gelen/ruya/b05/s03_0_MIRA.mp3", "voice": "Jessica", "lang": "en", "text": "Mom used to hum that song. I haven't heard it in years.", "vs": {"stability": 0.45, "similarity_boost": 0.8, "style": 0.3}}, {"out": "gelen/ruya/b05/s05_0_ELIAS.mp3", "voice": "Bill", "lang": "en", "text": "Tonight I will show you a room I have not opened in many years.", "vs": {"stability": 0.45, "similarity_boost": 0.8, "style": 0.3}}, {"out": "gelen/ruya/b05/s08_0_THEO.mp3", "voice": "Liam", "lang": "en", "text": "Whoa. Every jar is singing.", "vs": {"stability": 0.45, "similarity_boost": 0.8, "style": 0.3}}, {"out": "gelen/ruya/b05/s09_0_ELIAS.mp3", "voice": "Bill", "lang": "en", "text": "These are lost lullabies. Songs parents sang, that children forgot they ever heard.", "vs": {"stability": 0.45, "similarity_boost": 0.8, "style": 0.3}}, {"out": "gelen/ruya/b05/s12_0_MIRA.mp3", "voice": "Jessica", "lang": "en", "text": "It found something. That music box\u2026 it's playing our song.", "vs": {"stability": 0.45, "similarity_boost": 0.8, "style": 0.3}}, {"out": "gelen/ruya/b05/s14_0_MIRA.mp3", "voice": "Jessica", "lang": "en", "text": "Mom was singing. And Dad was pointing at the star. I remember now. I remember his voice.", "vs": {"stability": 0.45, "similarity_boost": 0.8, "style": 0.3}}, {"out": "gelen/ruya/b05/s15_0_THEO.mp3", "voice": "Liam", "lang": "en", "text": "Your dad? Mira\u2026 you never talk about him.", "vs": {"stability": 0.45, "similarity_boost": 0.8, "style": 0.3}}, {"out": "gelen/ruya/b05/s16_0_MIRA.mp3", "voice": "Jessica", "lang": "en", "text": "He went away when I was seven. I think I put the whole dream in a jar so it wouldn't hurt.", "vs": {"stability": 0.45, "similarity_boost": 0.8, "style": 0.3}}, {"out": "gelen/ruya/b05/s17_0_ELIAS.mp3", "voice": "Bill", "lang": "en", "text": "That is why it ran away. A dream wants to be remembered, even when it is sad.", "vs": {"stability": 0.45, "similarity_boost": 0.8, "style": 0.3}}, {"out": "gelen/ruya/b05/s19_0_SHADOW.mp3", "voice": "Callum", "lang": "en", "text": "Sad dreams are better forgotten. Give it to me, and the hurt goes away.", "vs": {"stability": 0.45, "similarity_boost": 0.8, "style": 0.3}}, {"out": "gelen/ruya/b05/s20_0_MIRA.mp3", "voice": "Jessica", "lang": "en", "text": "No. I want to remember. Even the sad parts.", "vs": {"stability": 0.45, "similarity_boost": 0.8, "style": 0.3}}, {"out": "gelen/ruya/b05/s23_0_THEO.mp3", "voice": "Liam", "lang": "en", "text": "Okay, new rule. When in doubt, sing at him.", "vs": {"stability": 0.45, "similarity_boost": 0.8, "style": 0.3}}, {"out": "gelen/ruya/b05/s24_0_NARRATOR.mp3", "voice": "Brian", "lang": "en", "text": "Two nights left. Mira had found the song. Now she needed the rest of the dream.", "vs": {"stability": 0.45, "similarity_boost": 0.8, "style": 0.3}}]}